From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:32:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] controllers: radial deadzones, Mac followups, prefs domain,
 and single Joy-Con hold

Consolidate dm_joycon radial stick deadzones (0036), Mac controller followups (0037), default preferences domain join (0054), native controller motion test priming (0058), and single Joy-Con SetNpadJoyHoldType handling (0072).

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Complete fork controller mapping, deadzone, motion test, and Joy-Con hold-type behavior on top of #221 and #2101
Issue: none
